  unitName: Shock Bow Loch
  unitId: 40163
  unitNumber: 249
  description: "One of the four legendary warriors who fought to save the Kingdom
    of Palmyna. While continuing his search for Princess Edea, Loch honed his skills
    with the bow so that he might one day join her in her fight against the gods.
    Upon finally reuniting with Edea, however, he was dismayed to hear the ice mage
    Dean cracking jokes with her. Loch\u2019s arrows were meant for the gods, but
    in a jealous fit of rage, they very nearly found a new target."
  summonDesc: I've dedicated all my training to<br>the one most important to me...<br>Who,
    you ask? Never you mind.
  fusionDesc: "I must train hard every day.<br>There\u2019s no telling when she <br>might
    need me."
  evoDesc: This is evolution, you say?<br>Hmm, not too shabby...<br>You've many talents,
    I see.
  element: 4
  rarity: 3
